":\"Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to the same amount as the premix (1:1 ratio), cover and rest for 5 minutes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I order from Swadam Foods?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Add products to the cart, complete the checkout form, and pay securely online. Payment is processed by PhonePe or, where used as an alternative, Razorpay. For help with an order, contact us on WhatsApp.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Swadam Foods a registered business?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, we are FSSAI registered and UDYAM MSME registered. We are a women-owned business based in Pune, Maharashtra.\"}}]}]}9:X\n0:{\"buildId\":\"ooCUeG71AqxupSo7Upf9E\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/20qo8-ip724ar.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/1q1-17_3ay0jy.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true,\"className\":\"bg-background manrope_9b24f49e-module__hJlnFq__variable\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"font-sans antialiased\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"src\":\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-9MMSSWSXB0\",\"strategy\":\"lazyOnload\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"id\":\"google-analytics\",\"strategy\":\"afterInteractive\",\"children\":\"window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\\nfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\\ngtag('js', new Date());\\ngtag('config', 'G-9MMSSWSXB0', { send_page_view: true });\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"attribute\":\"class\",\"defaultTheme\":\"light\",\"enableSystem\":true,\"disableTransitionOnChange\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[[\"$